      "Status is never colour alone: always icon + word.",
      "Petrol #0B5563 is retired. Primary is indigo #2E2BA0.",
      "Saffron #F5B43C is reserved for the logo fold and the 'your turn' (ERI) moment. Not for buttons, links, or warnings.",
      "Wordmark is one word, one colour ('YuklaGo'); use outlined SVGs in /workspace/yuklago-brand/export/, never retype it.",
      "Use U+02BB (ʻ) in oʻ / gʻ. Normalise U+0027, U+2018, U+2019, U+02BC to U+02BB in UI strings. Do not use IBM Plex Sans."
    ]
  },
